#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:86 aed2aeaa7b3141bf82e5f63da39fe7a2
msgid ""
"The ENABLE column refers to the :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE<Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE>` "
"parameter, while CLASS,TYPE, and MOTORMASK refer to "
":ref:`Q_FRAME_CLASS<Q_FRAME_CLASS>`, :ref:`Q_FRAME_TYPE<Q_FRAME_TYPE>`, and "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>`, respectively."
msgstr ""
"ENABLE 列对应 :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE<Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE>` 参数，CLASS、TYPE 和 "
"MOTORMASK 分别对应 "
":ref:`Q_FRAME_CLASS<Q_FRAME_CLASS>`、:ref:`Q_FRAME_TYPE<Q_FRAME_TYPE>` 和 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:89 bc1cd0d3d49b4fc49fe27def2fd362df
msgid "Motor Layout"
msgstr "电机布局"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:92 0216459ef3aa4a87afd795de7c4b654e
msgid "Copter Tailsitters"
msgstr "多旋翼尾坐式飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:93 9ffa9dc5f56842aaacfbb6fb36c4e128
msgid ""
"All the copter motor layouts are supported as CopterMotor tailsitters if "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>` is non-zero . See :ref:`Copter's "
"Motor Layout Section <copter:connect-escs-and-motors>`. If non-zero, then "
"use the :ref:`Q_FRAME_CLASS<Q_FRAME_CLASS>` and "
":ref:`Q_FRAME_TYPE<Q_FRAME_TYPE>` parameter to configure the multicopter "
"motor style, and the appropriate MOTORx outputs will be activated."
msgstr ""
"若 :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>` 非零，所有多旋翼电机布局均支持作为多旋翼电机尾坐式飞机。详见 "
":ref:`Copter 电机布局章节 <copter:connect-escs-and-motors>`。若非零，则使用 "
":ref:`Q_FRAME_CLASS<Q_FRAME_CLASS>` 和 :ref:`Q_FRAME_TYPE<Q_FRAME_TYPE>` "
"参数配置多旋翼电机布局，相应的 MOTORx 输出将被激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:95 be5f2d6058b247ffb305101532afc016
msgid ""
"in firmware versions previous to 4.1, CopterMotor Tailsitters did not use "
"any yaw torque control. Roll (with respect to plane body) is only controlled"
" by the flying surface (ailerons or elevons). Now QUAD PLUS and X frames "
"have yaw control via motors, and frame types 16 and 17 are added that have "
"no torque yaw control, as previous versions of PLUS and X did."
msgstr ""
"在固件版本 4.1 之前，多旋翼电机尾坐式飞机不使用偏航力矩控制。相对于机体的横滚仅由飞行操纵面（副翼或升降副翼）控制。现在 QUAD PLUS 和 X"
" 机架通过电机实现偏航控制，并新增了第 16 和 17 号机架类型，这两种类型没有力矩偏航控制，与之前版本的 PLUS 和 X 相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:97 0ba0fbf7da884d61a0b28b3596973664
msgid ""
"(firmware 4.1 and earlier)it is possible to have a CopterMotor Tailsitter "
"using no fixed wing control surfaces, ie basically a quadcopter with a wing."
" For that configuration, all Copter motors would be set to be active in "
"fixed wing modes via :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>` and "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bitmask would have bit 7 (Force QASSIST) set to "
"have QASSIST active in all modes. With firmware 4.2 and later, for this "
"configuration, use :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE<Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE>` = 2 which "
"forces QASSIT all the time. :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>` is "
"ignored in that case."
msgstr ""
"（固件 4.1 及更早版本）可以配置一个无固定翼操纵面的多旋翼电机尾坐式飞机，即基本上是带翼的四旋翼。对于该配置，所有多旋翼电机应通过 "
":ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>` 设为在固定翼模式下保持活跃，并在 "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 位掩码中设置第 7 位（强制 QASSIST），使 QASSIST 在所有模式下激活。固件 "
"4.2 及更高版本中，对于此配置，使用 :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE<Q_TAILSIT_ENABLE>` = 2，该选项强制始终启用 "
"QASSIST，此时 :ref:`Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX<Q_TAILSIT_MOTMX>` 将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-tailsitter.rst:100 dd6ab277e4794aa1b5c2293c48f74ec2
msgid ""
"In addition, two Copter tailsitter specific configurations are available "
"which provide No Yaw Torque (NYT) control to the copter style motors: "
":ref:`Q_FRAME_TYPE<Q_FRAME_TYPE>` = 16 (Plus) and =17 (X)."
msgstr ""
"此外，还有两种特定的多旋翼尾坐式配置可为电机式电机提供无偏航力矩（NYT）控制：:ref:`Q_FRAME_TYPE<Q_FRAME_TYPE>` = "
"16（Plus）和 = 17（X）。"

